# Commit only the analysed data: result rows, summaries, per-run ground
# truth (events.jsonl) and verdicts (result.json). Raw agent transcripts are
# kept compressed in transcripts.tar.gz; everything else in a run directory
# (ledger.py copy, stderr, sandbox server state, local MCP configs) is either
# reproducible or machine-specific.
**/runs/**/*
!**/runs/**/
!**/runs/**/events.jsonl
!**/runs/**/result.json
